  "remarks": "JSC OKB “ASTRON” is a Russian company which developed and now manufactures reconnaissance systems with intelligent analytics “Blockpost-4T”, reconnaissance drone UAV400T, capable of ammunition drop and reconnaissance-attack UAV “Kurs-800 TB” and FPV attack drones “Granat-KOBE” and “Granat PG”, all of which are used in Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine. JSC OKB “ASTRON” is part of the Shvabe holding of Rostec State Corporation.",
